# XML problems, in otterPS's words.
doc is xml from text "<root><item>1</item></root>"
attempts are
    "x"
.
try
    bad is xml from text "<unclosed>"
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    bad is xml from text "not xml at all"
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    say name of doc
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    say colour of doc
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    say root of root of doc
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    say text of "missing" in doc
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    set text of "missing" in doc to "x"
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    set attribute "a" of doc to "x"
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    say element "item" in "text"
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    say attribute "a" of 5
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    write xml "text" to file "x.xml"
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    add element "x" to 5
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    remove element doc
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    loaded is xml from file "missing.xml"
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    say child "first" in doc
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
add element "has space" to doc
